]\nShow Up Go Up is Barcelona’s most relaxed open mic — where anyone who shows...\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana\nGet Tickets ➟\nFree\nNov\n20\n🗓️\nFriday\n20\nNovember\n19:00-20:00\nThe Cosmic Crowd Work Show\nIn English [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/english/]\nStand-Up Comedy [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/stand-up-comedy/]\nTop Pick [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/top-pick/]\nAstrology, audience confessions and cosmic chaos collide in this interactive comedy show, with Anna Clifford.\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana\nGet Tickets ➟\n€7,00\nNov\n20\n🗓️\nFriday\n20\nNovember\n20:00-21:45\nThe Friday Spotlight\nIn English [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/english/]\nShowcase [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/showcase/]\nStand-Up Comedy [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/stand-up-comedy/]\nTop Pick [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/top-pick/]\nA curated Friday night line-up with rock-solid stand-up sets and a featured headliner.\nThe Comedy Clubhouse: Canvis Nous\nGet Tickets ➟\n€10,00 – €12,00\nNov\n20\n🗓️\nFriday\n20\nNovember\n21:00-22:45\nAtoMIC Comedy: Slay!\nIn English [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/english/]\nShowcase [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/showcase/]\nStand-Up Comedy [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/stand-up-comedy/]\nTop Pick [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/top-pick/]\nThe sassiest showcase in town is BACK!\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana\nGet Tickets ➟\n€8,00 – €10,00\nNov\n20\n🗓️\nFriday\n20\nNovember\n22:00-23:59\nFriday Night Live\nIn English [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/english/]\nShowcase [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/showcase/]\nStand-Up Comedy [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/stand-up-comedy/]\nTop touring comedians. Surprise drop-ins. Wildcard energy.\nThe Comedy Clubhouse: Canvis Nous\nGet Tickets ➟\n€10,00 – €12,00\nNov\n20\n🗓️\nFriday\n20\nNovember\n23:00 - 02:00\nClubhouse Karaoke\nAll Languages [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/all-languages/]\nFree [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/free/]\nMusic [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/music/]\nSing your heart out - Every Friday night!\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana\nGet Tickets ➟\nFree\nNov\n21\n🗓️\nSaturday\n21\nNovember\n15:00-17:00\nOpen Writing Workshop\nFree [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/free/]\nIn English [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/english/]\nStand-Up Comedy [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/stand-up-comedy/]\nWorkshop [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/workshop/]\nJoin us every Saturday for the Open Comedy Writing Workshop.\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana\nGet Tickets ➟\nFree\nNov\n21\n🗓️\nSaturday\n21\nNovember\n17:00-18:30\nShow Up Go Up\nFree [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/free/]\nIn English [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/english/]\nOpen Mic [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/open-mic/]\nStand-Up Comedy [https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/events/category/stand-up-comedy/]\nShow Up Go Up is Barcelona’s most relaxed open mic — where anyone who shows...\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana\nGet Tickets ➟\nFree\nLoad More\nSee All Our Events\n[https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/all-events/]\nWe Offer Two Venues in The Heart of Barcelona\nOur Two Venues\nin Barcelona\nOur two venues are just a short walk from each other.\nThe Comedy Clubhouse hosts live comedy across two nearby venues in the heart of Barcelona.\nEach venue offers a slightly different experience, the venue for your event will always be clearly listed on the event page and your ticket confirmation.\nlearn More\n[https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/venues/]\nThe Clubhouse Laietana\nComedy, food, and drinks — all in one place.\nThe Comedy Clubhouse Laietana is our social venue , combining live comedy with great food and a lively bar atmosphere. It’s the perfect choice if you’re looking to make a full night of it.\nVisit us at Via Laietana, 6, Ciutat Vella, 08003 Barcelona [https://maps.app.goo.gl/7yQoUTjRDYhoGRAL7]\nKey features\nFood available\nFull bar & social seating\nLive comedy, music, karaoke, pub quizzes, and more in a relaxed setting\nIdeal for dates and groups\nLearn More\n[https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/venues/]\nKey features\nFood available\nFull bar & social seating\nLive comedy, music, karaoke, pub quizzes, and more\nIdeal for dates and groups\nKey features\nIntimate seating\nClassic Stand-Up and Improv comedy atmosphere\nBar available before and after the show\nLearn More\n[https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/venues/]\nThe Comedy Clubhouse Canvis Nous\nAn intimate, classic comedy room focused on the show.\nThe Comedy Clubhouse Canvis Nous is our original comedy venue, a cosy, focused space designed purely for live stand-up. With an intimate layout and a classic comedy club feel, this venue is all about the performers and the crowd.\nVisit us at Carrer dels Canvis Nous, 10, Ciutat Vella, 08003 Barcelona [https://maps.app.goo.gl/7GoHVf1CeJtj5Kgo6]\nLearn More\n[https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/venues/]\nReviews\nWhat Our Guests Say\nThe Clubhouse: Laietana & Nikki's [https://maps.google.com/?cid=10441126671338093828&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA]\n4.9 Based on 94 reviews\npowered by\nreview us on [https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJTf5811CjpBIRBL32W2NV5pA]\nJames Regal [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100059289728889985866/reviews] 11 months ago\nMy favourite spot to hang out in Barcelona.\nSonakshi Van Horn [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116353551517351917847/reviews] 11 months ago\nTheir Mac & cheese is phenomenal!!!\nVíctor [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101411880774491104945/reviews] 11 months ago\nIncredible place!\nTorkey Hemdan [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115262799561120611640/reviews] 12 months ago\nThe bartenders are very helpful and nice, I would love to know more about the unicorn deal 🤍\nEmma Condie [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117891919121446540941/reviews] 1 year ago\nSuper cool venue. Great food and drinks. Loved the Fringe Festival show\npaddy byrne [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108426960830911145050/reviews] 1 year ago\nAmazing staff, super friendly and approachable. Such a welcoming place.\nThe food is 20 out of 10, the chicken is top quality soul food. Try the burgers, fries and the Mac and Cheese, all worth the visit.\nThey get some great musicians and Comedians for shows as well. Great place for a night out, a lot of lovely comedians hang out there, the atmosphere is special.\nA great bar, a great hang out spot, a great place to eat.\nHighly recommended!!!!\nSarah Langley [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115351756558117034054/reviews] 1 year ago\nMost wonderful experience I have had in Spain costumer service wise. the drinks are amazing. staff is caring and attentive which can be hard to find. offer karaoke and comedy which is so fun. COME HERE PLS\nAlazne Benito Cruz [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103709422132998850507/reviews] 1 year ago\nMe and my partner have been going to the original venue for almost 3 years now, and we are so happy and excited for the new venue! The space is very nice, much more spacious and so cool! In the bar, they have a good variety of bottled beers and the frozen margaritas were to die for. Also, the staff is always super friendly, welcoming and warm.\nWe will be coming back for the shows and to try the food too!\nThe Comedy Clubhouse: Canvis Nous [https://maps.google.com/?cid=9438791841954923152&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA]\n4.8 Based on 1,192 reviews\npowered by\nreview us on [https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJZ2Phg4-jpBIRkAKU4CtT_YI]\nEdward Herz [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109055057046976944982/reviews] 6 months ago\nWonderful club. So many different kinds of shows back to back. The prices for drinks are great and when you paid for one show you can enter the next one free of entry as well!\nDaverino Lambertini [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101499935131074778666/reviews] 6 months ago\nAmazing experience !!\nDavid Garcia Franco (Lierpooka) [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101527451619813370449/reviews] 7 months ago\nAmazing place, cheap drinks, great service and vibe\njames zazanis [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110857071604444185513/reviews] 7 months ago\nAbsolutely fantastic!\nPaul Scheel [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103459220544761005672/reviews] 11 months ago\nWe saw Michelle Wolf here, a huge name in the US, at a great intimate venue with a cool relaxed vibe. We came back to see Derek Mitchell (@letsdoubledutch on IG) who was also great. I was very impressed that a they drew in such well-known performers. I've seen several comedians in big shows and this setting was so much more memorable.\nAleksander Ekrem Olsen [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100214884067309783962/reviews] 11 months ago\nTwo lovely free open mic shows. Would be very very happy even if they charged 50€ a show.\nJake Graves is a genious!\nVibe Radar [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116546523908334212028/reviews] 11 months ago\nWe visited the venue last night, and The Matt Project was performing. The place was great, the temperature was pleasant, and the staff was friendly. However, the speakers were a bit muffled because we were standing close to them.\nMehdi Mirzaie [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109537617706566186903/reviews] 11 months ago\nWe visited the venue last night, and The Matt Project was performing. The place was great, the temperature was pleasant, and the staff was friendly. However, the speakers were a bit muffled because we were standing close to them.\nShane Lobsinger [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102390036195875547402/reviews] 11 months ago\nThis is a great little venue. I've been to the Anything Else? Open Mic twice and both shows were very enjoyable yet very different. It seems to be a really unique little art show where a diverse range of local performers and poets enjoy total creative freedom. I have laughed and cried, felt things and met new people.\nC. F. [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109616195721569583163/reviews] 12 months ago\nGreat atmosphere, friendly staff. I love coming to this place. Seen some fun shows here and I especially appreciate the “Anything Else” Open Mic nights every 2 weeks. It’s music/spoken word/storytelling and I’m surprised I don’t see more open mics like this in Barcelona, so I’m very grateful to have found it! Well run, and a great crowd.\nThanks to Kelly for running this! Keep up the great work. Also, if you should want to give the stage a try for yourself, Anything Else has a page on Instagram and Meetup where you can contact Kelly about a slot. You’d be a braver soul than I, though perhaps I will gather up the courage one day soon.\nNarong Chaijaraspong [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106330488124644038093/reviews] 1 year ago\nThis is one of the comedy clubs I have been. We went to it on Friday night to see a show produced by Belinda who is a very talented comedian. The show is called Bang, Marry, Kill where Belinda presents a bunch of the best comedians to perform a short set each and we the audience get to decide if we would Bang, Marry or Kill them (not literally 😆). It’s a very fun evening and I encourage if you are in town go and have a fun evening here if you are a fan of live entertainment. Do not miss it when you are in Barcelona!\nsteve kirwan [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116690875159445329616/reviews] 1 year ago\nIncredibly cute venue in Barcelonas Old Town with Bar and Cellar Stages. “Bang🍆Marry💍Kill🪓” is that impossible choice you just have to make!!\nSo much talent from an International line up Headed and Hosted by the totally Snoggable Belinda!! Make sure to Marry the Barmaid!! and Avoid being the last one to get a ticket!! 🎟️🎭\nMike B [https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105233930103707967015/reviews] 1 year ago\nI believe we were here on last wednesday night. The venue is awesome. You get to chill upstairs for a few drinks before the show starts and then head downstairs to a cozy little room where you are up close and personal with the comedians. We met a few that night which i was surprised that alot were from the USA. Fun show with some up and comers doing their thing. I would highly recommend for those that was a simple fun night out, that wont break the bank. Ask for Hannah, she will take care of you!\nFood\nFood & Drinks at The Clubhouse Laietana\nMake a night of it with great food, drinks, and live comedy at selected events.\nAt The Comedy Clubhouse Laietana , you can enjoy food and drinks before (and sometimes during) the show, perfect for date nights, groups, or anyone looking for a relaxed dinner-and-comedy experience.\nBoth venues offer a full bar, so you can always grab a drink and settle in before the show.\nFood is available during shows in The Alcove (upstairs) and before or after shows in The Lounge (downstairs)\nCheck Out Our Menu\n[https://thecomedyclubhouse.es/food/]\n[https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=34611619446&text] Any questions?"
  },
